{
  "evalFormatVersion": "2026-04",
  "name": "agentskit-retrieval-v1",
  "description": "Golden retrieval cases for the AgentsKit monorepo: exported symbols declared by exactly one module, real repository paths, and questions whose answer is a maintained documentation page. A case lists every page that genuinely answers it, so a correct answer is never scored as a miss. Portuguese cases use the code-switched phrasing a Brazilian developer types; three stay in pure Portuguese on purpose, to keep measuring the cross-lingual gap a lexical ranker cannot close. No ownership cases: this repository declares no ownership records, so an ownership query has no correct answer here.",
  "tags": [
    "retrieval",
    "agentskit",
    "deterministic"
  ],
